NAME
FV

DESCRIPTION
Cell-centred finite volume scheme for the
3D advection equation with a point source.

INPUTS
WIDGETS
control---Radio Box
reset, pause, run
Simulation control

convectX---Slider
Convection velocity: x-component

convectY---Slider
Convection velocity: y-component 

convectZ---Slider
Convection velocity: z-component

Grid Size---Slider
Number of grid lines per unit length of the domain.
Disabled unless Control is set to Restart.

X1---Slider
Minimum x-coordinate

X2---Slider
Maximum x-coordinate 

Y1---Slider
Minimum y-coordinate 

Y2---Slider
Maximum y-coordinate 

Z1---Slider
Minimum z-coordinate 

Z2---Slider
Maximum z-coordinate

timeZero---Slider
Simulation start time

timeMax---Slider
Simulationn end time

CFL---Slider
CFL number - used to control the timestep size

Run---Button
Displays the current timestep 

update---Slider
Number of steps before parameters are updated from the panel 

output---Slider
Number of steps before a Pyramid file is output


OUTPUTS

Output---Pyramid
(3-layer, 1..-baseLat, 3-D compression, unique-compression type)
Mesh and solution data from the simulation


PROBLEMS
CFL parameter should be less than 0.1 otherwise
Stability problems may occur


SEE ALSO

